OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FDocumentary series. Severe weather
OL,7,     Fconditions place the casualty
OL,8,     Fdepartment under pressure. Dr
OL,9,     FJulian and his sidekick Sister
OL,10,     FBenita treat a pensioner with a
OL,11,     Fbroken ankle.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FTwo ladies keep Dr Dev Shah busy:
OL,14,     Fone has a large lipoma on her
OL,15,     Fback, the other a cyst on her
OL,16,     Fforehead. 19-year-old Abby hopes
OL,17,     FDr Natalia Spierings can rid her
OL,18,     Fof lumps on her ears.
